++    """Return a NEW runbook with trail-derived evidence folded in (LORE-069).
++
++    ``fresh`` is the registry-compiled runbook; ``blocks`` are trail entries
++    (``{"kind","detail"}``, optionally ``observed_at``/``window``/``source``)
